      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical household shift from Jamshedpur to Balasore take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard move covering the 850 km corridor usually completes within 3.5 to 4 hours of transit time, excluding loading and unloading. The exact duration depends on cargo volume, traffic conditions on NH‑18/NH‑16, and any special handling requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What types of vehicles are used for moving large furniture on the Jamshedpur‑Balasore route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad deploys 18‑ft, 22‑ft, and 32‑ft multi‑axle container trucks equipped with hydraulic ramps and wheel chocks. These trucks are GPS‑tracked, have enclosed bodies, and can accommodate bulky items such as sofas, wardrobes, and pianos securely.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for intercity moves between Jamshedpur and Balasore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While not legally mandatory, we provide IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % declared value. This protects against loss or damage during the Jamshedpur to Balasore journey and is highly recommended for valuable or fragile items.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I claim the moving expenses from my employer or a government department?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our billing follows Indian Banks Association (IBA) guidelines and includes GST‑compliant invoices, e‑Way bills, and DRDO/academic relocation endorsements, making it easy to submit for Central/State government, PSU, or corporate reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does real‑time GPS tracking enhance the safety of my shipment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each container truck is fitted with satellite GPS that streams live location to a secure portal. Customers can monitor progress, receive alerts for any route deviation, and verify that their belongings are moving securely from Jamshedpur to Balasore.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I look for to avoid fake packers and movers on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Verify the mover’s IBA registration, GSTIN, and ISO‑9001 certification. Ask for a detailed quote, check online reviews (our 4.9/5 rating), and confirm the presence of GPS‑enabled trucks. Authentic movers will also provide transparent documentation and insurance options.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer any special packing for delicate items like glassware or temple idols?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our 7‑layer packaging includes heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard, stretch film, and custom wooden crates. This multi‑layer system ensures fragile glassware, idols, and electronics survive the Jamshedpur‑Balasore transit without damage.</p>
      </div>
